window.products.push({"id":733096,"name":"Weiei Portable Misting Neck Fan Hands Free Cooling Bladeless Fan, 3 Speeds Personal Neck Fan for Men Women Outdoor Office Travel (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zm-Pdf4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW MISTING FAN: The portable neck fan has an spray with 2 adjustable gears. New personal fan adds a cooling spray on the basis of wind cooling, which can hydrate and moisturize while feeling cool. It has 24 booster air ducts and 60 turbo fan blades to make the wind is increased by 45%, and the all-round wind can quickly cool down within 3 seconds, keeping you cool at all times. BLADELESS NECK FAN: The cooling neck fan adopts a bladeless design, which evenly cuts the airflow to make the wind spread more evenly, allowing you to feel the cool wind in all directions, and the wind blowing out is smoother and softer, quieter than traditional portable neck fan. And designed without wings, you don't have to worry about your hair getting caught on the fan blades. No distractions, more convenient. SAFETY & LIGHTWEIGHT: Hanging neck fan made of ABS silicone material, which is natural to wear and friendly to the skin, portable fan can be 360° rotated, you can adjust the direction at will and enjoy the cool wind from any angle. Personal neck fan weight is only 7.7 OUNCES, comfortable neckband design won't cause a lot of burden on your neck when worn for a long time. USB CHARGING & 3-SPEEDS: Using Type-C charging tech, wearable cooling fan can be charged from a variety of power sources, and it only takes two hours to fully charge, can work continuously for 2 to 8 hours (depending on the speed), stay cool for a long day even during power outage or going outside. Three wind speeds can be adjusted with just one touch, to let you experience the coolness brought by different wind speeds. IDEAL SUMMER SOLUTION: Hands free fan only needs to be hung around the neck to free your hands, inspired by earphones. You can stay stylish in the summer while also in a long time to keep cool. Perfect for both outdoor activities and home use, such as cooking, driving, traveling, camping, fishing and more . It is the best gift choice for families and friends!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zm-Pdf4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weiei","source_asin":"B0B2JTV5FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2JTV5FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2JTV5FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
