window.products.push({"id":733172,"name":"25 Pieces Premium 12\" Clear Round GOLD Confetti Balloons 3.2G Tough Latex Thickness filled with Gold round Foil Confetti for Weddings, Back Yard Parti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ed7XP+ozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a sensation at your Wedding, Anniversary, Shower, Back Yard Party and New Year celebration with these Confetti balloons. Each balloon comes with sparkly metallic confetti, which you can add crepe paper streamers and metallic ribbon garland to complete the effect. PRIME QUALITY durable 3.2 g thick Latex Balloons can pose a choking risk. See safety warning on pack before use. Recommended for ages 8+. Balloons are supplied uninflated Inflate with air or helium. Please note use a pump not mouth to inflate as they contain small parts Check Out our Foot Pumps we sell IMPORTANT NOTE – After inflating the balloons, to get the confetti to stick to the sides, rub inflated balloons on a carpeted surface or a pant leg to generate friction. How to use: As the gold confetti is heavier than the helium, will naturally move towards the direction of gravity. They make an impressive statement on their own - or you can team them with other balloons in different shapes and sizes to create your own balloon bouquet. Clear Balloons and Confetti Balloons If filling 12\" clear balloons with air not helium please note that once fully inflated they may seem a little dull or misty, they will clear in around 10 minutes. Helium creates an immediately clear balloon however the float time for Confetti filled helium balloons is less than standard balloons simply because of the extra weight of the confetti inside them (approx 6 -12 hours). If filling a confetti filled balloon with air, once the balloon is inflated you can create some static by rubbing the balloon on clothing or hair to help the confetti to stick to the inside. (how well the confetti sticks depends on the conditions like humidity, heat, etc How well your balloon stays filled or in the air very how it has been tied, how much it has been filled, what the weather on the day is like (are they in direct sunlight?) All our products are 100% Money Back Guarantee if not happy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ed7XP+ozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLOBAL HUNTRESS","source_asin":"B078VDK1LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078VDK1LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078VDK1LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
