window.products.push({"id":733330,"name":"Kasorix Tufted Massage Recliner Chairs with Heat 300lb Overstuffed Comfortable Manual Reclining Chair Single Sofa for Small Places (Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":309.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+YPjnir5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 【Massage Heated Recliners】This 1152 model manual recliner is specially added with massaging and lumbar heating functions, which can help relax muscles on different parts of body(back/lumbar/thighs/legs) and promote blood circulation. This is a very considerate design, especially for people after long hard work. Drive away tiredness, bring you great fun. ❤ 【Chic Tufted Backrest】Compared to most other recliner chairs on the market, this one looks quite unique and elegant for its attractive pattern of the backrest. Upholstered in soft and breathable fabric, the reclining single sofa has amazing comfy sense of touch, which will definitely not disappoint you. Overstuffed armrests are good to place your arms during the rest. ❤ 【Easy Operation & Dimensions】The recliner chair is easy to operate simply through pulling out the latch on the right armrest. The footrest will pop out automatically and you can go down for a nice position for resting with a little strength of back and arms. Overall Dimensions: 35.04\"(W)x36.22\"(D)x40.16\"(H). Seat Area: 21.5\"(W)x21.5\"(D)x18\"(H). Weight Capacity: 300lbs. ❤ 【One Package Delivery】Usually, recliner sofa will be divided into two boxes(may be three) when it is delivered, therefore increases the rate of missing parcels, or the arrival time of the two boxes is not at same day. We have improved the product packaging so that the modified products can be packed into one box, avoiding the trouble of two box distribution effectively. ❤ 【Clear Assembly Manual】Each chair arrives together with a detailed assembly manual to show you very clear installation steps. Our recliners enjoy 1 year warranty, we will replace the defective parts for free. If there are any questions, please contact us via Amazon messages, we will reply to you within 12-24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+YPjnir5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kasorix","source_asin":"B0C7BDXX3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7BDXX3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7BDXX3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
