window.products.push({"id":733350,"name":"Glass Baron Frog\"Rain Forest\" Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XBX2U+s6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Glass Baron Frog \"Rain Forest\" Large, individually hand-crafted glass figurine. PRODUCT FEATURES The origins of this colorful frog is from the deep rainforests of South America. The colors of blue's, green's, yellow's, and orange \"jump out\" at you because they are not painted on the outside (the skin). The skin is a clear glass and the colors are painted inside the \"dome\" on the piece thus causing these bright colors to \"jump out\" at you. Approximate measurements: 2.75 W x 3.5 L x 1.25\" H Made by Glass Baron Model no. S3 217-YN The beautiful Glass Baron Collection of glass figurines are designed from high quality, three dimensional handblown glass. Each glass figurine piece is skillfully handcrafted using one or more of the following techniques: Sandblasting the surface of the glass where thousands of microscopic chips of glass are removed to achieve a frosted finish. Airbrushing adds natural color enhancements by skilled airbrush artists who hand paint each piece using the highest quality, custom made paints. Each of the porcelain and clay flowers are hand made petal by petal and individually applied to the glass sculptures. Accented with Swarovski Crystals, sparkle color and personality is added to many of the Glass Baron figurines. 22 karat liquid gold is skillfully brushed on by hand and then kiln-fired for a perfect shine. Each Glass Baron piece is beautifully handcrafted in the United States","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XBX2U+s6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glass Baron","source_asin":"B00BSXDZDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BSXDZDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BSXDZDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
