window.products.push({"id":733429,"name":"FunDADYUS Popcorn Maker, Home Electric Air Popcorn Maker Machine with ETL Certified, BPA Free, No Oil, DIY Flavors, Popcorn Popper for Home Movie/Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GEgNT5hDL._AC_SL1153_.jpg","description":"Why choose our ? The principle of using hot air to cancel the fuel is used to heat, and the corn kernels are fried, which is simple, quick and healthier. Satisfy all tastes Use pop corn make to make your pop corn poppers taste like sugar, chocolate, butter, sea salt, coconut oil, cheese, peanut butter, etc. Protected Radiator The turbine of pop corm machines is heated uniformly. Popcorn airpopper has special air duct design which can conduct hot air rapidly and uniformly to achieve heat dissipation effect, thus extending the life of popcorn air popper machine. Low noise Pop corn makers has a raceway outlet at the bottom, which effectively solves the noise in the production process. Large Capacity With a larger heating chamber and a new linear air outlet design, the air popcorn poppers can make 3.5 ounces of popcorn m&ms at a time. How to use 1. Remove the lid from popcorm machines and, using the containing cup, place the popcorn kernel in the center of popcorn air popper machine. 2. Replace the transparent cover of popcorn hot air popper and place the measuring cup on top of the tortilla maker. 3. Place the container at the exit of popcorn machines for home is popcorn. 4. Plug in popcorn machine parts and turn on popcorn maker with wide mouth. 5. Enjoy a bowl of hot homemade popcorn m&m while waiting. Note: 1. Do not pour cream or other popcorn oil for machine products into popper popcorn maker. 2. When batman popcorn maker is in operation, the internal temperature will rise. Please do not touch popcorn machine maker. 3. It is not suitable for children to use air pop popcorn maker alone. 4. Air popped popcorn maker is used continuously for 5 minutes and needs to dissipate heat for 10 minutes. 5. When cleaning airpop popcorn maker is plastic parts with a wet cloth, do not use abrasive products, otherwise they may damage airpopper popcorn maker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GEgNT5hDL._AC_SL1153_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunDADYUS","source_asin":"B08S3SLGP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S3SLGP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S3SLGP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":733430,"name":"USB Charging Stainless Steel Electric Magnetic Water Cup Milk Coffee Self Stirring Mixing Mug. Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Capacity:400mlMaterial: Stainless Steel Product Information: 1.Under action of a magnetic field, the nature of water changes and becomes magnetized water with biological effects. 2.With one‑button switch, it can easily stir milk and coffee, suitable for home bedroom, study room, office. 3.Selected high‑quality stainless steel + food‑grade plastic materials, safe and non‑toxic, can rest assured to use. 4.Built‑in rechargeable battery, which can be used for one month after 2 hours of charging (combined with frequency of use). 5.With a lid, it is safe and leakproof, and can be used as a water cup by inserting a straw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"qing niao","source_asin":"B08PCZNW3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCZNW3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PCZNW3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":733431,"name":"Modus Furniture Farmhouse Bench","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713UzonjqpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Farmhouse Bench features an 18-inch seat height for use with 30-inch high tables and is constructed from mango solid wood and forged iron. Features slatted solid wood shelf for space-saving storage. Sandblasted Antique Walnut finish creates the rustic feel of reclaimed wood. Matching Farmhouse table, chair, wine tower, sideboard and media console also available (sold separately). Forged ironwork is sealed with an oxidized finish that lends it the patina of age. Corner braced legs with oversize bolts for easy assembly. Durable solid wood surfaces resists scratches and dents. Simplicity, function and fine craftsmanship are the hallmarks of classic farmhouse style. With the Farmhouse dining collection Modus not only honors, but builds on these qualities. Thick planks of hardwood are selected and planed by hand then accented with sandblasting to create the rustic feel of reclaimed wood. Forged ironwork is sealed with an oxidized finish that lends it the patina of age. Exposed bolts and sheet metal doors complete the utilitarian, form-meets-function appeal. Wood components are crafted entirely from solid mango wood without the use of veneers, composite woods or resins. Primarily used in agriculture, a mango tree stops producing quality fruit after about twenty years and needs to be cut down. Harvesting the wood completes nature's natural cycle without depleting the world's forests. Mango wood is a hard, dense wood, displaying vibrant color properties unlike most other woods, with green, brown and yellow hues. This collection is artisan crafted with meticulous care. Given its handmade and hand-finished nature, variations in the wood or metal work are to be expected and celebrated. Each item is unique and no two are exactly alike. By their nature, solid wood planks may be somewhat uneven and may cup or bow slightly over time, further enhancing their rustic one of a kind character. Package includes 1 Farmhouse Bench. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713UzonjqpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B007V98MZI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007V98MZI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007V98MZI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
