window.products.push({"id":733640,"name":"G-TING Water Bottle Organizer, 4-Tier Wall-Mounted Water Bottle Rack Storage Organizer Adjustable, Stackable Vertical Standing Water Bottle Holder Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71729atdDIL._AC_SL1132_.jpg","description":"🍶『Easy to Storage and Grab』When you open your cabinet do water bottles fall or roll out? These bottles can be hard to store, but you can use this bottle storage rack on a counter, or inside a cabinet or on a pantry shelf, to keep these bottles easy to grab and ready for use. Each bottle had a designated spot so that we never had to rearrange things to make them fit, and where we’d never have to worry about bottles tipping over and falling out of the cabinet. 🍶『Maximizes Vertical Space』Utilize every inch of cabinetry space with this 4-Tier bottle organizer rack that will keep your bottles organized and easy to access. Each tier organizer holds about 3-4 bottles, stack these racks to create vertical storage to help maximize your space. It’s a great way to take advantage of vertical storage space in your kitchen cabinets. The shelves snap together for an easy setup that doesn’t require any tools. 🍶『Multifunctional Storage Shelf』An adjustable shelf fits large or little bottles without wasting space. This bottle organizer featuring 2 adjustable dividers is great for storing large or small water bottles. If your kitchen cabinets are packed to the brim with reusable water bottles, travel mugs, sports drinks, sodas, and tumblers, get organized with this bottle organizer. Ideal for your kitchen, dining room, cabinet, home bar, study or Bathroom. 🍶『Innovative Design - Wall Mounted』If you don't want to laid out the rack on the table, you can also hang it on the wall! The space-saving design de-clutters your countertops while keeping kitchen and Cabinet items within reach. Simply mount to your wall with minimal effort with the included hardware. You can also display your makeup, framed photos, books or small plants to add an elegant look to your walls. 🍶『Makes Good Use Of Your Storage Shelf』Bottle Organizer measures 8.7”deep, 11.3” wide, and 14.2” tall. Sturdy durable metal construction, rustless, iron art adopts the high-intensity welding technique orderly and solid in the weld. Not just for storage bottles. It’s also a perfect solution to organize and store any clutter like condiments, spices, snack food, makeup, toiletries, first aid supplies, plates,bath towel,shower gel or scarves. More USES waiting for you to find.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71729atdDIL._AC_SL1132_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G-TING","source_asin":"B08LD1Q912","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LD1Q912","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LD1Q912","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
