window.products.push({"id":733656,"name":"Custom Tapestry Aesthetic Customized Personalized Funny Wall Hanging Art Tapestries Upload Images Custom Backdrops, Banners and Signs, Posters, Flags ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712uWCFmnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Customizing a tapestry] allows you uploading your own images and you can use the Amazon tool to preview the effect accordingly as seen during the customization process. Important Note!!! : Please make sure that the image you upload covers the entire canvas area, any white border may be printed on the final product. Image resolution: 75 DPI resolution is required. For good results, your digital camera resolution should be no less than 12 megapixels. [Customized gift tapestry] A perfect gift customized for various holidays such as wedding anniversary, birthday, baby shower, graduation ceremony, Easter, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving Day, New Year's Day and more. This is the ideal gift for family, friends, partners, pets, mom, dad, boyfriend, girlfriend, daughter, son, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, sister. [Multi-purpose tapestry] Ideal for wall hangings, bedroom decorations, sofa covers, beach blankets, picnic blankets, party decorations, wedding tapestries, porch hangings, tablecloths, bedspreads, curtains Home decor [Easy to hang] The custom tapestry is soft and drapable, easy to hang and store, with 2 barb clips and 3 non-marking nail hooks, simply fix the ends of the tapestry to the wall, easy to install and will not damage the wall [Washing and Fabric Care]. Tapestry can be machine washed and hand washed, easy to clean without worrying about wrinkles. Note: Dry in a cool place or iron with low temperature. Please do not bleach. [Quality Service]. When you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will get back to you quickly. We are honored to have you as our customer and we will do our best to make you happy with your purchase!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712uWCFmnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naykow","source_asin":"B0BNBSX9NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBSX9NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBSX9NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
