window.products.push({"id":733709,"name":"Bzyoo 12 Piece Melamine Plastic Dinnerware Set - Organica Navy Blue Plates and Bowls Sets Casual Dish Set for Dining, Outdoor and Kitchen BPA Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+yVjwOIOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN DESIGN: Our design is unique and different from other melamine products in the market. For those who prefer simple design with the modern touch. This set is designed the combination of matte and shiny for its luxurious texture and appearance. These dishes have a matte surface and finished with attractive shiny pattern on top of it. It can be tastefully layered together and makes a wonderful addition to existing dinnerware pieces, table linen, and surrounding decor. SERVICE FOR FOUR: The 12 piece collection includes 4 dinner plates (11”), 4 salad plates (9”) , and 4 individual bowls (5.8”) that are great for both indoor and outdoor use. PERFECT FOR CASUAL INDOOR AND OUTDOOR USE: This high quality melamine casual dinnerware set is great for both indoor and outdoor use; will not chip or crack easily. It is perfect for outdoor entertaining, from causal family barbecues to dinner parties. This lightweight yet sturdy dinnerware set makes it easy to transport and serve meals. BEST FOR SERVING YOUR FOODS: Made from food safe melamine, they are perfect for snack, salad, noodle, pasta. These melamine looks like elegant dinnerware with a fraction of the weight. Throw away those flimsy paper plates and replace them with this dinnerware set. MADE OF 100% FOOD SAFE MELAMINE: Made of 100% high quality melamine, 100% BPA free, toxin-free and odor-free for health safety. Melamine is the best quality food-safe material on the market, and on top of that, it looks like porcelain and ceramic, yet its more durable and not easy to break. DISHWASHER SAFE: Just put into the dishwasher for a fast and easy cleaning method, you can clean it very easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+yVjwOIOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bzyoo","source_asin":"B07YD6GXVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD6GXVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD6GXVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
