window.products.push({"id":733827,"name":"Wreath Hanger for Glass Doors, Metal Doors & Screen Doors – ZIPNHANG XTRA: Adjustable Wreath Hangers for Front Door, Damage Free Over the Door Hooks. ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p+LFBBgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 WREATH HANGER FOR GLASS DOORS & SCREEN DOORS THAT WON'T DAMAGE YOUR DOORS – Bulky metal over-the-door hooks can damage glass doors, metal doors, screen doors and their frames, but now you can hang almost any item on glass, screen, or steel doors without using nails, tools, or adhesive hooks. No more bent door frames, scratched doors or tape that leaves sticky residue. Finally, damage-free hanging for glass, metal, and screen doors! 🔥 DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR METAL, GLASS & SCREEN DOORS – Compared to our original model, ZipnHang XTRA has thicker, stronger lines to resist sharp corners on metal, screen, and storm doors. ZipnHang XTRA replaces magnetic wreath hangers for metal doors, magnetic wreath hanger for glass doors, suction cup wreath hangers for glass doors and heavy-duty suction cup hooks. It’s also the ideal wreath hanger for storm doors. 🌷 FRONT DOOR WREATH HANGER THAT IS READY TO HANG IN 10 SECONDS AND ADJUSTS TO ANY HEIGHT – Just push the button on the side of ZipnHang to raise or lower the hook to whatever height you need. Even for tall or wide doors, ZipnHang adjusts to your needs. It’s great for hanging items lower on the door – traditional metal or plastic over-the-door hooks can’t do that! If you can wrap a string around your door’s upper corners, ZipnHang is your door-hanging solution. 🚪 WREATH HANGER FOR FRONT DOOR – ZipnHang holds up to 10 pounds. The clear hanging strings are industrial-strength lines that can hold large holiday wreaths and other decorations securely while being nearly invisible. This is the inconspicuous door wreath hanger you’ve been looking for! Just zip out the two clear lines, hook them over the door corners, and your door hanger is ready to hold something beautiful! No unsightly hooks – it looks like the decoration is floating on your door. WHY ZIPNHANG XTRA? 1. For Screen Doors: suction cups and adhesive hooks won’t work on uneven surfaces. Also, most wreath hangers are too wide for the top of any screen door. 2. For Glass Doors: magnetic hooks aren’t always strong enough to work on glass doors. 3. Won’t damage your metal door, screen door or glass door – adhesive hooks leave sticky residue & metal hooks scratch doors and door frames. 🌧️ NOT RECOMMENDED FOR DOORS WITH METAL INTERLOCKING WEATHERSTRIPPING - Some homes (especially some built between the 1930's and 1950's in stormy regions) may use this type of weatherstripping, which can cut ZipnHang lines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p+LFBBgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zip 'n Hang","source_asin":"B09G4FS1RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-733827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G4FS1RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G4FS1RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
