window.products.push({"id":734000,"name":"HOME ART DECOR Nightmare Before Christmas Vinyl Wall Clock Gift Housewarming Gift Idea Modern Handmade Gift Unique Clock Gift Birthday Party Gift for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gfUx4esbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazing-looking vintage wall clock made from used vinyl records. Detailed information about the product: We may change a clock dial for you for no additional charges Clock movement works quiet and your favorite clock will serve you for a very long time The size our the clock is 12\" We pack our handmade clock in a separate protected box. You can choose one of the templates developed by our professional designers or you can create your own design and we will implement it for you. The vintage vinyl record clock will suit to any design and interior. Order one for yourself and enjoy the words of delight from your friends, colleagues and neighbors. We will need around 2-3 working days to make you vinyl record wall clock and send it to you. Then it takes around 7-11 working days to be delivered to you. Tracking number is provided. We will refund you the money or send you another clock free of charge within 30 days after you receive the clock in case the clock comes broken. Please provide pictures. Your little piece of art is waiting for you. Don't doubt!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gfUx4esbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME ART DECOR","source_asin":"B07RQZ8P38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQZ8P38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQZ8P38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":734001,"name":"STAUB Cast Iron Dutch Oven 3-qt Tomato Cocotte, Made in France, Serves 2-3, Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":233.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71++w+cswtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The resounding success of the Staub Pumpkin had us asking what other heirloom fruit or vegetable should we bring to Staub. We wanted something that could compliment the pumpkin for the collector. We scoured farmer's markets to find our muse, and after much looking we landed on the Brandywine Tomato. The Brandywine is an heirloom cultivar which bears large beautiful tomatoes that are popularly considered among the very best tasting. The Staub cocotte is unsurpassed for slow-cooking meats and vegetables to tender perfection, and for simmering hearty stews and soups. Cast iron possesses exceptional heat-retaining qualities, so the pot heats evenly throughout. This pot also makes a handsome serving vessel at the table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71++w+cswtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAUB","source_asin":"B07633QNFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-734001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07633QNFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07633QNFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
